    <div class="ts-section-num">§ 32 — The Final Galus</div>
    <div class="ts-card-title">Ziknah d'Sitra Achra & Complete Geulah</div>
    <div class="ts-card-body">Final Geulah heavier than Mitzrayim: complete, no galus after it. Baal Davar's strategy: make us feel "old" and hopeless. <em>Ziknah</em> d'Sitra Achra = denial of <em>Chidush HaOlam</em>. Elders lacking completeness fuel the <em>kefiros</em>. Root of all evil desire = <em>eil acher</em> = <em>kefiros</em>. <strong>Hope: emunah + Tefillin of Rabbeinu Tam.</strong> Through years of emunah: <em>matei v'lo matei</em>.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="ts-card c7">
    <div class="ts-section-num">§ 33 — Uva l'Tziyon & Mizmor Ya'ancha</div>
    <div class="ts-card-title">Seventy Cries = Seventy Faces</div>
    <div class="ts-card-body"><em>Ya'ancha</em>: 70 words = 70 cries of a woman in labor = 70 faces of Torah that must be birthed. After the cries: "<em>Uva l'Tziyon Go'el</em>" = Geulah. "<em>Ul'shavei fesha</em>" = ba'alei teshuvah renewing their days. "<em>Chadeish yameinu k'kedem.</em>"</div>
  </div>

  <div class="ts-card c8">
    <div class="ts-section-num">Note</div>
    <div class="ts-card-title">§31 Does Not Appear in the Source</div>
    <div class="ts-card-body">The source text jumps from <em>Os Lamed</em> (§30) directly to <em>Os Lamed-Beis</em> (§32). §31 is not present — likely merged into §30 by the original copyist given the unity of the material.</div>
  </div>

</div><!-- /ts-grid -->

<!-- Central Insight -->
<div class="ts-insight">
  <div class="ts-insight-label">Central Principle of Part D</div>
  <div class="ts-insight-text">
    <em>Ehyeh</em> — "I am preparing to become."<br>
    The true Tzaddik is never "arrived." Each day he stands<br>
    at absolute zero — <em>ana zamin l'meihevei</em> —<br>
    and precisely this is the secret of <em>eternal life.</em><br><br>
    Against this stands Amalek — the <em>old and foolish king</em><br>
    who denies <em>Chidush HaOlam</em> and whispers:<br>
    "The world is old, you are old, there is no renewal."<br>
    <em>Emunah</em> passes over everything.
  </div>
</div>

